## Overview

This configuration provisions Oracle ExaDB infrastructure on GCP using the
[Oracle AI Database@Google Cloud](https://cloud.google.com/oracle/database) service.

Resources are managed as `map(object)` variables — **no code changes are needed
to add more instances**. Simply append a new entry to `terraform.auto.tfvars`
and re-run `terraform apply`.

