## Deploy

```bash
{% if adbs %}
# 1 — Supply the ADMIN password for each Autonomous Database. This is never
#     written to a generated file, and plan/apply fail without it.
export TF_VAR_gcp_adb_admin_passwords='{ {% for a in adbs %}{{ a.module_name }} = "..."{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %} }'

# 2 — Initialise providers and modules
terraform init

# 3 — Preview changes
terraform plan

# 4 — Apply
terraform apply
{% else %}
# 1 — Initialise providers and modules
terraform init

# 2 — Preview changes
terraform plan

# 3 — Apply
terraform apply
{% endif %}
```

Expected creation times:

| Resource | Typical Duration |
|---|---|
| ODB Network + subnets | 5–10 min |
{% if wants_dedicated %}
| Exadata Infrastructure | 30–60 min |
| VM Cluster | 60–120 min |
{% endif %}
{% if adbs %}
| Autonomous Database (Serverless) | 5–15 min |
{% endif %}

